    "text": "KXII.com\nwebsite\nArdmore\nPursuit that started in Ardmore ends in crash\nBy KXII Staff,\n4 hours agoARDMORE, Okla. (KXII) - A pursuit that started in Ardmore ended with a crash near the Love County line. Ardmore Police said the pursuit began in city limits, and other agencies joined in as it left the city. Oklahoma Highway Patrol the pursuit ended with a crash at Highway 77 and Cisco Road.",
